{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"octane","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown/octane"},{"type":"text","value":" entry requires Octane 0.1.12 or newer."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  Markdown,\n  renderBlockOctane,\n  renderInlineOctane,\n  renderMarkdownOctane,\n  type MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  type MarkdownProps,\n} from '@tanstack/markdown/octane'","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"markdownoctaneoptions","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MarkdownOctaneOptions"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" with:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"interface MarkdownOctaneOptions extends RenderOptions {\n  components?: Partial<\n    Record<string, string | ComponentBody<any>>\n  >\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"},{"type":"text","value":" replaces an emitted intrinsic or custom element by tag name."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"markdownprops","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MarkdownProps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MarkdownOctaneOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"children: MarkdownInput"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"markdown","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Markdown"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function Markdown(props: MarkdownProps): ElementDescriptor","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Renders the document children inside an Octane fragment descriptor."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rendermarkdownoctane","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderMarkdownOctane"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderMarkdownOctane(\n  input: MarkdownInput,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n): OctaneNode[]","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns rendered Octane nodes without the fragment wrapper."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"renderblockoctane","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderBlockOctane"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderBlockOctane(\n  node: BlockNode,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  key?: string,\n): ElementDescriptor","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Renders one block node. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":" is available for custom tree composition; normal document rendering supplies deterministic positional keys."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"renderinlineoctane","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderInlineOctane"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderInlineOctane(\n  node: InlineNode,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  key?: string,\n): OctaneNode","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Renders one inline node."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../guides/octane.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for TSRX, component mapping, and SSR usage."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"octane","text":"Octane","level":1},{"id":"markdownoctaneoptions","text":"MarkdownOctaneOptions","level":2},{"id":"markdownprops","text":"MarkdownProps","level":2},{"id":"markdown","text":"Markdown","level":2},{"id":"rendermarkdownoctane","text":"renderMarkdownOctane","level":2},{"id":"renderblockoctane","text":"renderBlockOctane","level":2},{"id":"renderinlineoctane","text":"renderInlineOctane","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Octane\n\nThe `@tanstack/markdown/octane` entry requires Octane 0.1.12 or newer.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  Markdown,\n  renderBlockOctane,\n  renderInlineOctane,\n  renderMarkdownOctane,\n  type MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  type MarkdownProps,\n} from '@tanstack/markdown/octane'\n```\n\n## `MarkdownOctaneOptions`\n\nExtends `RenderOptions` with:\n\n```ts\ninterface MarkdownOctaneOptions extends RenderOptions {\n  components?: Partial<\n    Record<string, string | ComponentBody<any>>\n  >\n}\n```\n\n`components` replaces an emitted intrinsic or custom element by tag name.\n\n## `MarkdownProps`\n\nExtends `MarkdownOctaneOptions` with `children: MarkdownInput`.\n\n## `Markdown`\n\n```ts\nfunction Markdown(props: MarkdownProps): ElementDescriptor\n```\n\nRenders the document children inside an Octane fragment descriptor.\n\n## `renderMarkdownOctane`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderMarkdownOctane(\n  input: MarkdownInput,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n): OctaneNode[]\n```\n\nReturns rendered Octane nodes without the fragment wrapper.\n\n## `renderBlockOctane`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderBlockOctane(\n  node: BlockNode,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  key?: string,\n): ElementDescriptor\n```\n\nRenders one block node. `key` is available for custom tree composition; normal document rendering supplies deterministic positional keys.\n\n## `renderInlineOctane`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderInlineOctane(\n  node: InlineNode,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  key?: string,\n): OctaneNode\n```\n\nRenders one inline node.\n\nSee the [Octane Guide](../guides/octane.md) for TSRX, component mapping, and SSR usage.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Octane\n---\n\n# Octane\n\nThe `@tanstack/markdown/octane` entry requires Octane 0.1.12 or newer.\n\n```ts\nimport {\n  Markdown,\n  renderBlockOctane,\n  renderInlineOctane,\n  renderMarkdownOctane,\n  type MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  type MarkdownProps,\n} from '@tanstack/markdown/octane'\n```\n\n## `MarkdownOctaneOptions`\n\nExtends `RenderOptions` with:\n\n```ts\ninterface MarkdownOctaneOptions extends RenderOptions {\n  components?: Partial<\n    Record<string, string | ComponentBody<any>>\n  >\n}\n```\n\n`components` replaces an emitted intrinsic or custom element by tag name.\n\n## `MarkdownProps`\n\nExtends `MarkdownOctaneOptions` with `children: MarkdownInput`.\n\n## `Markdown`\n\n```ts\nfunction Markdown(props: MarkdownProps): ElementDescriptor\n```\n\nRenders the document children inside an Octane fragment descriptor.\n\n## `renderMarkdownOctane`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderMarkdownOctane(\n  input: MarkdownInput,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n): OctaneNode[]\n```\n\nReturns rendered Octane nodes without the fragment wrapper.\n\n## `renderBlockOctane`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderBlockOctane(\n  node: BlockNode,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  key?: string,\n): ElementDescriptor\n```\n\nRenders one block node. `key` is available for custom tree composition; normal document rendering supplies deterministic positional keys.\n\n## `renderInlineOctane`\n\n```ts\nfunction renderInlineOctane(\n  node: InlineNode,\n  options?: MarkdownOctaneOptions,\n  key?: string,\n): OctaneNode\n```\n\nRenders one inline node.\n\nSee the [Octane Guide](../guides/octane.md) for TSRX, component mapping, and SSR usage.\n"}
